# TextFSM template: Nokia SR OS / TiMOS `traceroute`.
#
# TiMOS emits three probes per hop on a single line. Resolved
# hostnames precede the parenthesised IP when reverse DNS lookups
# succeed; timed-out probe slots are denoted by `*`.
#
# Sample output:
#   traceroute to 1.1.1.1, 30 hops max, 40 byte packets
#    1  10.0.0.254 (10.0.0.254)  0.234 ms  0.222 ms  0.211 ms
#    2  one.one.one.one (1.1.1.1)  8 ms  8 ms  8 ms
#    3  * * *
#
# Header capture uses a non-value group for the resolved hostname
# so it does not Filldown onto every transit hop. Numbered-probe
# columns ip1/rtt_ms1/hostname1 … are expanded into three probes
# per hop by the projector.
Value Filldown target ([^,\s]+)
Value Required ttl (\d+)
Value ip1 ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value hostname1 ([\w.\-]+)
Value rtt_ms1 (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value ip2 ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value rtt_ms2 (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)
Value ip3 ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value rtt_ms3 (\d+(?:\.\d+)?)

Start
  ^traceroute\s+to\s+${target},
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+${hostname1}\s+\(${ip1}\)\s+${rtt_ms1}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms2}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms3}\s+ms -> Record
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+${ip1}\s+${rtt_ms1}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms2}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms3}\s+ms -> Record
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+${hostname1}\s+\(${ip1}\)\s+${rtt_ms1}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms2}\s+ms\s+\* -> Record
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+${ip1}\s+${rtt_ms1}\s+ms\s+${rtt_ms2}\s+ms\s+\* -> Record
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+${ip1}\s+${rtt_ms1}\s+ms\s+\*\s+\* -> Record
  ^\s*${ttl}\s+\*\s+\*\s+\* -> Record
